          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-001.closer/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-001.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-001-Brain-Flow.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, the natural pattern of healthy circulation, renewal,\nand maintenance in your brain and neck is now firmly established.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce this pattern, simply close\nyour eyes and bring your attention to the area you choose.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nSilently say to yourself, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth, as though gently\nblowing out a candle, and open your eyes.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Brain Flow exercise.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-001.closer/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-001.closer/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-001-Brain-Flow.yaml",
          "value": "1.3.1",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-001.closer/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-001.function-body/cue_template/allowed/0": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-001-Brain-Flow.yaml",
          "value": "cue.primary",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-001.function-body/cue_template/allowed/0"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-001.function-body/cue_template/function_id": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-001-Brain-Flow.yaml",
          "value": "OCF-BOD-001",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-001.function-body/cue_template/function_id"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-001.function-body/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-001-Brain-Flow.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-001.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-001.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-001-Brain-Flow.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, bring your awareness to the blood\ncirculating throughout your brain and the blood vessels in your\nneck that supply it.\n\nImagine this circulation becoming stronger, smoother, and more\nbalanced with every passing moment.\n\nSee and feel your blood flowing freely and evenly, carrying\noxygen and nourishment to every part of your brain.\n\nBecome aware of the arteries and veins that carry this blood.\n\nVisualize each vessel becoming stronger, healthier, and more\nflexible, maintaining the ideal size and shape for smooth,\nnatural circulation.\n\nImagine every restriction clearing, and see these pathways\nbecoming open and free for balanced circulation.\n\nNow visualize your body's natural processes of renewal and\nmaintenance working together in complete harmony.\n\nImagine healthy circulation pathways strengthening and renewing,\nwith each part of the system receiving exactly the support it needs.\n\nSee this entire network becoming stronger, more efficient,\nand perfectly balanced.\n\nFeel the strength and vitality of this healthy circulation\nthroughout your brain.\n\nKnow that this pattern of healthy circulation, renewal, and\nmaintenance is now firmly established within you.\n\nFrom this moment forward, it will continue automatically,\nwithout any need for conscious thought or effort.\n\nWhether you are awake, resting, or sleeping, your body's natural\ncirculation and maintenance systems will continue working for you.\n\nThey will respond to your body's needs, adjusting smoothly and\nprecisely, providing what is needed and returning to their\nnatural balance when their work is complete.\n\nThis is a lasting, automatic pattern of healthy maintenance,\nalways working at the appropriate level for your body.\n\nYour mind will become clearer, your thinking sharper, and your\nresponses quicker and more precise.\n\nYour awareness will strengthen, your concentration will improve,\nand your thoughts will flow smoothly and naturally.\n\nEach day, clear thinking and mental sharpness will become more\nnatural, steady, and effortless.\n\nWhenever you wish to give this established pattern additional\nattention and reinforcement, you can do so quickly and easily.\n\nSimply close your eyes and bring your attention to the area\nyou wish to strengthen.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth, as though gently\nblowing out a candle.\n\nAs you exhale, visualize circulation becoming smoother,\nstronger, and more balanced throughout your chosen area.\n\nYour mind will reinforce this already-established pattern\nof healthy circulation, renewal, and maintenance.\n\nEach time you use {{ cue.primary }}, conscious reinforcement\nof this pattern becomes easier, faster, and more effective.\n\nRemember, the maintenance pattern continues automatically,\nwhether or not you think about it.\n\n{{ cue.primary }} is always available whenever you choose\nto focus and reinforce it.\n\nYour mind will remain clear, sharp, alert, and ready\nwhenever you need it.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-001.function-body/text"
        },
