          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-002.closer/cue_template/function_id"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-002.closer/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-002-Circulation.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-002.closer/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-002.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-002-Circulation.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, your body's natural pattern of healthy circulation\nand maintenance is now firmly established.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce circulation in any part\nof your body, simply close your eyes.\n\nBring your attention to the area you choose.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nSilently say to yourself, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth, as though\ngently blowing out a candle, and open your eyes.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Circulation exercise.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-002.closer/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-002.closer/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-002-Circulation.yaml",
          "value": "1.3.0",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-002.closer/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-002.function-body/cue_template/allowed/0": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-002-Circulation.yaml",
          "value": "cue.primary",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-002.function-body/cue_template/allowed/0"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-002.function-body/cue_template/function_id": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-002-Circulation.yaml",
          "value": "OCF-BOD-002",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-002.function-body/cue_template/function_id"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-002.function-body/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-002-Circulation.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-002.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-002.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-002-Circulation.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, bring your awareness to the blood\ncirculating throughout your entire physical body.\n\nFeel your blood flowing smoothly and evenly, reaching every\npart of you with the oxygen and nourishment it needs.\n\nBecome aware of the arteries, veins, and tiny blood vessels\nthat carry this flow throughout your body.\n\nSee and feel each vessel becoming stronger, healthier,\nand more flexible, maintaining its ideal shape and size\nfor smooth and natural circulation.\n\nImagine every restriction clearing, and see the pathways\nof circulation becoming open and free.\n\nSee your entire circulation system working smoothly,\nevenly, and efficiently.\n\nNow bring your awareness to the nourishment carried\nby your blood.\n\nWith every breath, your lungs supply the oxygen your\nbody needs, and your digestive system provides the\nnutrients that sustain your strength and vitality.\n\nYour blood carries this oxygen and nourishment throughout\nyour body, delivering it where it is needed.\n\nFeel the energy and vitality of this nourishment\nreaching every part of you.\n\nYour lungs, kidneys, liver, and other organs work\ntogether to process and eliminate waste and to\nmaintain your body's natural balance.\n\nYour body's protective and maintenance systems work\ntogether in complete harmony, each doing exactly\nwhat is needed.\n\nNow know that this pattern of smooth circulation,\nnourishment, and maintenance is firmly established\nwithin you.\n\nFrom this moment forward, your body will maintain\nthis healthy pattern automatically, without conscious\nthought or effort.\n\nWhether you are awake, resting, or sleeping, your\nnatural circulation and maintenance systems will\ncontinue working for you.\n\nBlood flow will adjust smoothly and appropriately\nto the needs of each part of your body, supplying\nmore where needed and maintaining balance throughout.\n\nThis automatic process will remain naturally regulated,\nproviding exactly what your body needs without\nunnecessary strain or excess.\n\nThe pattern is lasting and continuous, becoming a\nnatural part of your everyday life.\n\nWith each passing day, your circulation will become\nsmoother, more balanced, and more efficient.\n\nYou will feel stronger, refreshed, and full of\nnatural vitality.\n\nWhenever you wish to give this established pattern\nadditional attention and reinforcement, you can\ndo so quickly and easily.\n\nSimply close your eyes and bring your awareness\nto the area you wish to improve.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth, as though\ngently blowing out a candle.\n\nAs you exhale, visualize smooth, balanced circulation\nthroughout your chosen area.\n\nYour mind will reinforce this already-established\npattern of healthy circulation and maintenance.\n\nEach time you use {{ cue.primary }}, conscious\nreinforcement of this pattern becomes easier,\nfaster, and more effective.\n\nRemember, your body's natural circulation and\nmaintenance will continue automatically, whether\nor not you think about it.\n\n{{ cue.primary }} is always available whenever\nyou choose to focus and reinforce this pattern.\n\nYour blood will flow smoothly and evenly,\nbringing nourishment and vitality throughout\nyour body.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-002.function-body/text"
        },
