        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-003.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-003-Comfort.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to reduce discomfort\nin any part of your body, simply close your eyes.\n\nBring your attention to the area\nwhere the discomfort begins.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nThe discomfort will diminish,\nbecoming less and less important to you.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Comfort exercise.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-003.closer/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-003.closer/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-003-Comfort.yaml",
          "value": "1.2.1",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-003.closer/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-003.function-body/cue_template/allowed/0": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-003-Comfort.yaml",
          "value": "cue.primary",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-003.function-body/cue_template/allowed/0"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-003.function-body/cue_template/function_id": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-003-Comfort.yaml",
          "value": "OCF-BOD-003",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-003.function-body/cue_template/function_id"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-003.function-body/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-003-Comfort.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-003.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-003.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-003-Comfort.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, whenever you wish to reduce\nphysical discomfort in any part of your body,\nyou can do so quickly and easily.\n\nBegin by bringing your awareness to the area\nwhere the discomfort begins.\n\nClose your eyes and focus your attention on that area.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nAs you exhale, the discomfort signals will begin\nto diminish, becoming weaker and weaker.\n\nFeel the discomfort fading away,\nless and less, until it no longer demands\nyour attention.\n\nYour body will become more comfortable,\ncalm, and relaxed.\n\nYour mind will become clear and peaceful,\nfree to focus on whatever you choose.\n\nYou will remain aware of your body's needs\nwhile experiencing greater comfort and ease.\n\nWhenever you wish to reduce discomfort,\nsimply close your eyes, inhale deeply,\nand gently hold your breath.\n\nFocus on the area of discomfort and silently\nsay to yourself, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth.\n\nThe discomfort will quickly become less and less,\nfading into the background until it is\nno longer important to you.\n\nEach time you use {{ cue.primary }},\nthis process becomes easier, smoother,\nfaster, and more effective.\n\nYou are in control of your response to discomfort.\n\nYou can return to a state of calm,\ncomfort, and relaxation whenever you desire.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-003.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-003.function-body/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-003-Comfort.yaml",
          "value": "1.2.1",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-003.function-body/version"
        },
