        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-004.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-004-Detox.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, your body's natural processes of cleansing,\nrenewal, and maintenance are now firmly established\nas a lasting, automatic pattern.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce this pattern,\nsimply close your eyes.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nSilently say to yourself, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Detox exercise.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-004.closer/text"
