          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-007.closer/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-007.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-007-Blood-Pressure-Balance.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, your body's natural systems\nof blood pressure regulation and\ncardiovascular maintenance continue\nworking automatically every day and every night.\n\nYour heart and blood vessels work together,\nresponding naturally to your body's needs.\n\nYour ability to release unnecessary tension\nand return to a calm, balanced state\nis now firmly established within you.\n\nWhenever you wish to reinforce this pattern,\nsimply close your eyes.\n\nBring your attention to your heart\nand blood vessel system.\n\nInhale comfortably and gently hold your breath.\n\nSilently say to yourself,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Blood Pressure Balance exercise.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-007.closer/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-007.closer/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-007-Blood-Pressure-Balance.yaml",
          "value": "1.2.1",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-007.closer/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-007.function-body/cue_template/allowed/0": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-007-Blood-Pressure-Balance.yaml",
          "value": "cue.primary",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-007.function-body/cue_template/allowed/0"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-007.function-body/cue_template/function_id": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-007-Blood-Pressure-Balance.yaml",
          "value": "OCF-BOD-007",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-007.function-body/cue_template/function_id"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-007.function-body/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-007-Blood-Pressure-Balance.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-007.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-007.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-007-Blood-Pressure-Balance.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, bring your awareness\nto your heart and the blood vessels throughout\nyour entire physical body.\n\nBecome aware of the natural rhythm of your heart\nand the smooth, steady circulation of your blood.\n\nYour heart and blood vessels work together,\nsupplying every part of your body with\nthe oxygen and nourishment it needs.\n\nNow become aware of your body's natural\nability to regulate and balance blood pressure.\n\nYour body has systems designed to coordinate\nthe activity of your heart, blood vessels,\nand circulation according to your needs.\n\nVisualize these systems working together\nsmoothly, efficiently, and in complete harmony.\n\nSee your blood vessels remaining healthy,\nstrong, and naturally flexible.\n\nFeel your body becoming calm and relaxed,\nallowing unnecessary tension to fade away.\n\nYour breathing becomes comfortable and steady.\n\nYour muscles relax, your thoughts become clear,\nand your entire body settles into\na natural state of calm and balance.\n\nWith every comfortable breath, you become\nmore relaxed, more peaceful, and more at ease.\n\nNow visualize your cardiovascular system\nmaintaining the healthy balance your body needs.\n\nYour heart works smoothly and efficiently,\nand your blood vessels respond naturally\nto the changing needs of your body.\n\nWhen you are resting, your body settles\ninto a calm and comfortable state.\n\nWhen you are active, your cardiovascular\nsystem adjusts appropriately to support\nyour body's increased needs.\n\nYour natural regulatory systems coordinate\nthese changes smoothly and efficiently.\n\nEvery part of your cardiovascular system\nworks together to support healthy circulation\nand balanced blood pressure.\n\nKnow that this pattern of calm, awareness,\nand healthy cardiovascular maintenance\nis becoming firmly established within you.\n\nFrom this moment forward, your mind\nwill naturally reinforce this pattern\nof relaxation and cardiovascular balance.\n\nThis pattern is now a lasting,\nautomatic part of your everyday life.\n\nWhether you are awake, resting, or sleeping,\nyour body's natural regulatory systems\ncontinue performing their important work.\n\nYour heart and blood vessels respond\nappropriately to your body's needs,\nmaintaining the balance required\nfor healthy circulation.\n\nYou will naturally recognize unnecessary\nphysical tension and release it.\n\nYour breathing will become comfortable,\nyour muscles will relax,\nand your mind will return to a calm,\nclear, and balanced state.\n\nEach day, this response becomes\nmore familiar, easier, and more automatic.\n\nYou are establishing a lasting pattern\nof calm, relaxation, and conscious awareness\nthat supports your cardiovascular well-being.\n\nWhenever you wish to consciously reinforce\nthis pattern of relaxation and balance,\nyou can do so quickly and easily.\n\nSimply close your eyes and bring\nyour awareness to your heart\nand blood vessel system.\n\nIf you wish, focus your attention\non a particular area of your body.\n\nTake a comfortable breath in\nand gently hold it.\n\nWhile holding your breath, silently say\nto yourself, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen slowly exhale through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nAs you exhale, feel unnecessary tension\nleaving your body.\n\nYour mind becomes calm and clear.\n\nYour muscles relax, your breathing settles,\nand you return to a comfortable\nstate of balance and ease.\n\nVisualize your heart and blood vessels\nworking together smoothly,\nnaturally, and efficiently.\n\nYour mind reinforces this established\npattern of healthy cardiovascular awareness,\nrelaxation, and balance.\n\nEach time you use {{ cue.primary }},\nyour ability to enter this calm,\nbalanced state becomes easier,\nfaster, and more effective.\n\nThis response becomes increasingly natural\nand familiar each time you practice it.\n\nRemember, your body's natural processes\nof cardiovascular regulation and maintenance\ncontinue automatically.\n\nYou do not need to consciously direct\nevery heartbeat or adjustment.\n\nYour body performs these natural functions\naccording to its needs.\n\n{{ cue.primary }} remains available\nwhenever you wish to consciously reinforce\nyour established pattern of relaxation\nand healthy cardiovascular awareness.\n\nFrom this moment forward, you will find\nit easier and easier to release tension,\nbecome calm, and maintain a comfortable,\nbalanced state throughout your day.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-007.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-007.function-body/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-007-Blood-Pressure-Balance.yaml",
