          "value": "From this moment forward, your body's natural processes\nof digestion, nourishment, and energy utilization\nare becoming more efficient and balanced.\n\nYour body knows how to obtain the nourishment it needs,\nuse that nourishment effectively, and maintain\nits natural balance.\n\nThis healthy pattern is becoming a permanent,\nautomatic part of your body's everyday function.\n\nWhenever you wish to direct how your body\nuses the food you eat, you have two commands.\n\nThe first is \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nWhen you use {{ cue.primary }}, your body will\nextract the greatest possible useful nourishment\nand energy from the food you eat.\n\nIt will convert and distribute that nourishment\nquickly and efficiently, making the fullest\npossible use of the food available.\n\nThe second command is \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-BOD-010-FOOD-LESS }}.\"\n\nWhen you use {{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-BOD-010-FOOD-LESS }}, your body will\nrecognize that nourishment is plentiful\nand there is no need to store unnecessary excess.\n\nYour body will take from the food you eat\nexactly what it needs for healthy energy,\nbalance, and maintenance.\n\nAny excess that is not needed will be\nsafely and efficiently processed and released\nthrough your body's natural systems,\nrather than unnecessarily retained or stored.\n\nYour body will maintain the nourishment it needs\nwhile releasing what serves no useful purpose.\n\nYour body's natural intelligence knows the difference\nbetween what is needed and what is unnecessary.\n\nTo activate either function, close your eyes.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}\"\nor \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-BOD-010-FOOD-LESS }},\" according to your desire.\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth\nand open your eyes.\n\nYour body will respond to your chosen command,\ndirecting its use of food energy accordingly.\n\nThe more you use these functions,\nthe easier and more effective they will become.\n\nYour body's natural processes of nourishment,\nenergy utilization, and metabolic balance\nwill continue working automatically,\nevery day and every night.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-010.function-body/text"
        },
