        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-011.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-011-Hormonal-Transitions.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to restore\nphysical, mental, and emotional balance\nduring hormonal changes, inhale deeply\nand hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nAs you exhale, you may also express gratitude\nto amplify the entire process.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Hormonal Transitions exercise.",
