          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to regulate\nyour sexual arousal, inhale deeply\nand hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}\"\nto increase arousal, or \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-BOD-012-SEX-LESS }}\"\nto reduce and redirect it.\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth\nand resume breathing naturally.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Sex Drive exercise.",
