        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-012.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-012-Sex-Drive.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability\nto consciously direct your sexual desire\nand physical arousal whenever you choose.\n\nYour mind and body work together in harmony,\nresponding quickly and naturally to your intentions.\n\nWhenever you wish to increase your sexual desire\nand arousal, use the command \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nYour sexual energy will increase,\nbringing greater desire, sensitivity,\nand physical responsiveness.\n\nFeel this energy flowing naturally\nthroughout your body, strengthening\nyour sense of pleasure, vitality,\nand intimate connection.\n\nWhenever you wish to reduce sexual arousal,\nuse the command \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-BOD-012-SEX-LESS }}.\"\n\nYour arousal will quickly and comfortably diminish,\nbecoming less and less until your mind\nand body return to a calm, balanced state.\n\nThe sexual energy you no longer wish to express\nwill be redirected toward other constructive purposes,\nstrengthening your physical vitality,\nmental clarity, creativity, and concentration.\n\nYour attention will shift naturally\ntoward whatever you choose,\nfree from unwanted sexual distraction.\n\nTo activate either function,\ntake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nThink or say in your mind,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}\" or \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-BOD-012-SEX-LESS }},\"\naccording to your desire.\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth\nand resume breathing naturally.\n\nYour mind and body will respond\nquickly and effectively to your chosen command.\n\nFrom this moment forward, this ability\nto consciously regulate your sexual arousal\nis permanently established within you.\n\nYour natural sexual responsiveness will remain\nbalanced and adaptable, responding appropriately\nto your intentions and circumstances.\n\nWhenever you wish greater arousal,\nyou can increase it.\n\nWhenever you wish less arousal,\nyou can comfortably release it.\n\nEach time you use these functions,\ndirecting your sexual energy becomes\neasier, faster, and more effective.\n\nThis lasting ability is always available,\nallowing you to direct your sexual desire\nand responsiveness whenever you choose.",
