        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-013.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-013-Body-Tune-Up.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, your body's natural\nprocesses of balance, healing, and regeneration\nare becoming stronger, smoother, and more effective.\n\nEvery part of your physical body is supported\nby its natural ability to maintain, repair,\nand renew itself.\n\nYour body's systems work together in harmony,\nrecognizing what needs attention and directing\nthe appropriate processes of restoration.\n\nYour cells, tissues, and organs receive\nthe nourishment and support they need\nto maintain their healthy function.\n\nWhenever an area requires additional care,\nyour body's natural processes of healing\nand regeneration will respond,\nrestoring strength, balance, and harmony.\n\nFrom this moment forward, this pattern\nof whole-body maintenance and renewal\nis permanently established within you.\n\nWhether awake, resting, or sleeping,\nyour body continues these processes\nautomatically, without conscious effort.\n\nWhenever you wish to perceive and improve\nany particular part of your body,\nyou can do so quickly and easily.\n\nSimply close your eyes and bring\nyour awareness to the area you wish to improve.\n\nLook inward and become consciously aware\nof that part of your physical body.\n\nTake a deep breath in and gently hold it.\n\nThink or say in your mind,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth\nand open your eyes.\n\nYour body's natural processes of repair\nand regeneration will respond,\ndirecting their activity toward the chosen area.\n\nThat part of your body will move steadily\ntoward its natural state of health,\nstrength, and balanced function.\n\nYour entire system knows how to coordinate\nthese processes and will perform\nthem smoothly and effectively.\n\nEach time you use {{ cue.primary }},\nyour ability to perceive and direct\nthis process becomes easier,\nfaster, and more effective.\n\nYour body's natural pattern of healing,\nrenewal, and balanced maintenance\nwill continue automatically,\nevery day and every night.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-013.function-body/text"
        },
