        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-014.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-014-Regenerate.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to direct regeneration\ntoward any part of your physical body,\nclose your eyes and picture that area\nrestored to its healthy form and function.\n\nInhale deeply and hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth\nand open your eyes.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Regenerate exercise.",
