          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-014.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-014.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-014-Regenerate.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, your body's natural\npowers of repair, rebuilding, and regeneration\nare becoming stronger and more effective.\n\nYour physical body contains the knowledge\nand biological patterns from which\nits healthy structures were originally formed.\n\nThese patterns guide your body's natural\nprocesses of cellular renewal, repair,\nand organized tissue growth.\n\nWhenever any part of your body is injured,\ndamaged, weakened, or missing,\nyour regenerative processes will respond,\nworking toward the restoration\nof its healthy form and function.\n\nBring your awareness to the remarkable\nability of living cells to renew,\nmultiply, specialize, and work together\nto create healthy tissue.\n\nYour body's natural regenerative signals\ncoordinate these processes,\ndirecting rebuilding where it is needed.\n\nHealthy circulation provides the oxygen\nand nourishment required for this work,\nwhile your body's maintenance systems\nclear away damaged and unnecessary material.\n\nNew healthy tissue forms in the proper\nstructure, position, and organization,\nrestoring strength, connection, and function.\n\nEvery part of this process works in harmony\nwith the rest of your physical body.\n\nRegeneration proceeds accurately,\ncreating what is needed and completing\nits work when the proper structure is restored.\n\nFrom this moment forward, this pattern\nof repair, reconstruction, and regeneration\nis permanently established within you.\n\nWhether awake, resting, or sleeping,\nyour body's natural regenerative processes\ncontinue automatically, without conscious effort.\n\nWhenever you wish to direct additional\nregenerative activity toward a particular area,\nclose your eyes and focus your attention\non the part you wish to restore.\n\nPicture its complete, healthy form\nand the function it is designed to perform.\n\nIf its precise internal structure is unknown,\nallow your body's natural intelligence\nto guide the rebuilding process.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth\nand open your eyes.\n\nYour entire physical system will respond,\ndirecting its coordinated processes\nof repair, rebuilding, and regeneration\ntoward the selected area.\n\nEach time you use {{ cue.primary }},\ndirecting this regenerative pattern\nbecomes easier, faster, and more effective.\n\nYour body's natural powers of regeneration\nwill continue working automatically,\nrestoring healthy structure and function\nwherever rebuilding is needed.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-014.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-bod-014.function-body/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-BOD-014-Regenerate.yaml",
