        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-001.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-001-Information-Access.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, your ability to access\nyour personal library of information and knowledge\nis becoming stronger, faster, and more effective.\n\nEverything you have learned, experienced,\nobserved, and understood contributes\nto this vast library within you.\n\nInformation may come into your awareness\nas words, images, memories, feelings,\nsensations, or sudden understanding.\n\nYour mind recognizes these different forms\nand brings them together to provide\nthe knowledge and understanding you seek.\n\nYour personal library is always available,\nready to provide the information you desire.\n\nFrom this moment forward, this ability\nto access your knowledge is permanently\nestablished within you.\n\nYour mind will continue organizing\ninformation automatically, connecting\nrelated ideas and experiences,\neven when you are not consciously\nthinking about them.\n\nWhenever you desire information\nfrom your personal library,\nsimply think or say in your mind,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen focus clearly on the information,\nknowledge, or understanding you desire.\n\nThe information you seek will immediately\nbegin moving into your conscious awareness.\n\nThe answer will become clear to you,\narriving naturally in whatever form\nbest communicates the knowledge you need.\n\nWords, images, feelings, and understanding\nwill come together, allowing you\nto recognize and use the information.\n\nThe more you use {{ cue.primary }},\nthe easier, faster, and more effective\nthis process will become.\n\nYour personal library of knowledge\nwill remain available to you\nwhenever you desire to access it.\n\nNow think of something you wish to know\nor understand more clearly.\n\nSilently say, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nAllow the information to come\ninto your conscious awareness.\n\nBegin exploring your personal\nlibrary of knowledge now.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-001.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-001.function-body/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-001-Information-Access.yaml",
