          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-002-Mental-Calculation.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to strengthen\nyour ability to calculate or understand numbers,\ninhale deeply and hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Mental Calculation exercise.",
