          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-003.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-003.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-003-Contemplation.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability\nto commune with your total self whenever you desire.\n\nYour conscious mind, your subconscious mind,\nyour higher self, and all deeper aspects\nof your being are connected as one complete self.\n\nWhenever you wish to open this communication,\nsimply close your eyes, inhale deeply,\nand gently hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth\nand breathe naturally.\n\nYour physical body will become deeply relaxed,\nwhile your mind remains bright, awake,\ncalm, and fully aware.\n\nCommunication throughout your total self\nwill become clear, open, and effortless.\n\nYou will be able to ask questions,\nreceive answers, and understand the knowledge,\nwisdom, and experiences within your greater self.\n\nInformation will come into your awareness\nas words, images, memories, feelings,\nsensations, or direct intuitive understanding.\n\nYour subconscious mind will communicate\nfreely with your conscious awareness,\nbringing forward knowledge and understanding\nthat was previously beyond your waking attention.\n\nYour higher self will become open\nto communication, offering its greater\nperspective, wisdom, and understanding.\n\nMemories and experiences held within\nyour total self will become available\nwhenever you desire to perceive them.\n\nYou will recognize, understand, and remember\nwhat you experience, remaining calm,\nconfident, and serene throughout.\n\nFrom this moment forward, this ability\nto communicate with your total self\nis permanently established within you.\n\nWhenever you choose to enter contemplation,\nthis deeper communication will open\nnaturally and easily.\n\nWhenever you wish to end the present\nstate of contemplation, simply think\nor say in your mind, \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-COG-003-CLOSED }}.\"\n\nYour conscious awareness will return\nsmoothly to its normal state,\nwhile the knowledge and understanding\nyou have gained remain available to you.\n\nYou remain in complete control,\nable to open or close this communication\nwhenever you choose.\n\nEach time you use this function,\ncommunion with your total self\nbecomes easier, clearer, and more effective.\n\nThis lasting ability is always available,\nready whenever you choose to explore\nthe deeper consciousness of your total self.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-003.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-003.function-body/version": {
