        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-006.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-COG-006-Recall.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, your ability to remember\nand recall information and experiences is becoming\nstronger, clearer, and more effective.\n\nYour mind naturally organizes and preserves your memories,\nkeeping the knowledge and experiences of your life\navailable whenever you wish to remember them.\n\nWhenever you desire to recall something,\nbegin by focusing on the information\nor experience you wish to remember.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nThe memory you seek will immediately come into\nyour conscious awareness, clear, vivid, and complete.\n\nYou will remember the details of the experience,\nincluding the images, words, sounds, feelings,\nand sensations associated with it.\n\nThe information will return naturally and effortlessly,\nallowing you to recognize and understand\nwhat you remember.\n\nFrom this moment forward, this ability to recall\ninformation and experiences is permanently\nestablished within you.\n\nWhenever you use {{ cue.primary }}, your mind will bring\nthe desired information into your awareness\nquickly, clearly, and in great detail.\n\nEach time you use this function, recalling\ninformation becomes easier, faster,\nand more effective.\n\nYour memories remain available to you,\nready to return to your conscious awareness\nwhenever you desire.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-cog-006.function-body/text"
        },
