          "value": "Remember, whenever harmful foreign substances\nenter or contact your body, you can consciously\nreinforce its natural protective response.\n\nInhale deeply and hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Toxic Exposure Response exercise.",
