        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emg-002.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EMG-002-Toxic-Exposure-Response.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, whenever a harmful\nforeign substance enters or contacts your body,\nyour natural protective systems will immediately\nbegin responding with greater speed,\ncoordination, and effectiveness.\n\nWhether the substance is a chemical,\npoison, pesticide, herbicide, venom,\nor something introduced through a bite\nor sting, your body will recognize\nthe disturbance and respond appropriately.\n\nYour protective systems will work together\nto limit the harmful substance's effects\nand maintain the best possible balance.\n\nYour circulation, immune defenses,\nliver, kidneys, lungs, and digestive system\nwill coordinate their natural functions\naccording to what your body requires.\n\nHarmful substances will be identified,\ncontained where appropriate,\nprocessed and neutralized when possible,\nand directed toward safe elimination\nthrough the proper pathways.\n\nYour body's natural protective responses\nwill operate in intelligent balance,\nresponding only as strongly\nand for as long as needed.\n\nThe affected areas will receive\nthe protection and support needed\nto restore healthy function.\n\nFrom this moment forward, this automatic\nprotective response is permanently\nestablished within you.\n\nWhether awake, asleep, or unable\nto consciously direct the response,\nyour body's protective systems\nwill activate whenever harmful\nexposure is recognized.\n\nWhenever you are conscious and able,\nyou can strengthen this response\nthrough a simple command.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth.\n\nYour body's protective and elimination\nprocesses will become more coordinated,\ndirecting their efforts toward\ncontrolling and clearing the disturbance.\n\nYour mind will remain as calm,\nclear, and responsive as possible,\nallowing you to recognize what is needed\nand take appropriate action.\n\nAs the harmful exposure is addressed,\nyour body will continue working\ntoward balance, recovery,\nand restoration of normal function.\n\nEach time you use {{ cue.primary }},\nconsciously reinforcing this protective\nresponse becomes easier and more effective.\n\nYour body's natural intelligence\nremains ready to protect, balance,\nand restore your physical system\nwhenever such a response is needed.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emg-002.function-body/text"
        },
