          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EMO-001-Let-Go.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to release\nan unwanted or interfering emotion,\ninhale deeply and hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Let Go exercise.",
