        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-003.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EMO-003-Empathize.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to understand\nanother being through your senses and total self,\nbring that being clearly into your awareness.\n\nInhale deeply and hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Empathize exercise.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-003.closer/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-003.closer/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EMO-003-Empathize.yaml",
          "value": "1.2.1",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-003.closer/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-003.function-body/cue_template/allowed/0": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EMO-003-Empathize.yaml",
          "value": "cue.primary",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-003.function-body/cue_template/allowed/0"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-003.function-body/cue_template/function_id": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EMO-003-Empathize.yaml",
          "value": "OCF-EMO-003",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-003.function-body/cue_template/function_id"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-003.function-body/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EMO-003-Empathize.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-003.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-003.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EMO-003-Empathize.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, your ability to perceive\nand understand another being is becoming deeper,\nclearer, and more complete.\n\nYou are connected to the greater whole of life.\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind,\nand higher self work together as your total self,\nopening every available way of knowing.\n\nWhenever you desire to understand another being,\nbring that being clearly into your awareness.\nRelax your body, quiet your own expectations,\nand become calm, open, and receptive.\n\nThrough your physical senses, you recognize\nexpression, movement, voice, and subtle changes.\nBeyond those senses, you remain open to intuition,\nemotional impressions, images, feelings,\nand direct, wordless understanding.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth.\n\nYour total self will now bring together\nevery form of information available to you,\nrevealing a clearer understanding of the\nother being's feelings, needs, intentions,\nand state of being.\n\nCommunication will become possible beyond words:\nfeeling to feeling, awareness to awareness,\nand thought to thought.\n\nWhether you are physically present or exploring\nin an out-of-body state, your greater awareness\nwill remain open to subtle and nonphysical\nimpressions and communication.\n\nYour higher self will help you recognize\nthe connection between yourself, the other being,\nand the greater consciousness of which all are part.\n\nUnderstanding will arrive in the form most natural\nto you: a clear feeling, an image, a thought,\na sensation, or immediate inner knowing.\n\nYou will remain centered in your own awareness,\nunderstanding without imposing your desires\nor losing your sense of self.\n\nFrom this moment forward, this ability\nis permanently available whenever you choose\nto open yourself to deeper understanding.\n\nThe more you use {{ cue.primary }},\nthe easier, clearer, and more effective\nthis communion and understanding will become.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-003.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-003.function-body/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EMO-003-Empathize.yaml",
          "value": "1.2.1",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-emo-003.function-body/version"
        },
