        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-001.closer/notes": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-001-Manifest.yaml",
          "value": "OCF-authored closer adapted from the previously approved reminder. Original SOURCE +Transcripts From available tapes/Möbius West/Möbius West.txt; SHA-256 9013a12a0b32bb22db8433b49c2e834029456e01007534ebc42acfcd21adec78. The unverified source ends in numeric runs and has no recoverable function-specific closer. Retains one purpose reminder, desired outcome and timing, the original inhale-hold-command-exhale sequence, and the existing OCF ending. Representation-neutral wording includes nonvisual intention. Plus Manifest remains resolved through cue.primary. This is OCF-authored wording, not historical transcription. Existing source rights: user_cleared, per user's lawyer-clearance attestation. Revised wording awaits explicit editorial approval. Finished-session release remains pending.",
