          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-001-Manifest.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, to manifest a chosen outcome,\nbring it clearly into your awareness\nand choose when you wish it to take form.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth.\n\nThis concludes your OCF exercise.",
