        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-001.function-body/notes": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-001-Manifest.yaml",
          "value": "OCF-adapted narration based on the unverified Möbius West transcript. Original SOURCE +Transcripts From available tapes/Möbius West/Möbius West.txt; SHA-256 9013a12a0b32bb22db8433b49c2e834029456e01007534ebc42acfcd21adec78; lines 55–84. Original reference remains unchanged; duplicate second pass remains excluded. Preserves outcome and desired-time selection, the original inhale-hold-command-exhale sequence, total-self alignment, intention beyond the physical self, continuing operation, and greater well-being without destructive effects on others. The active command remains the reviewed Plus Manifest supplied through cue.primary; no command definition changes. Version 2.0.0 adds substantive editorial content informed by the user-supplied Plus Create comparison: release of struggle and impatience, heart-centered love, balanced energy centers, grounded receptivity, worthiness, supportive guidance, and the intended outcome or an aligned improvement. The comparison has no independently verified bibliographic attribution in this review; additions are not represented as recovered historical wording. Clear intention is supported through imagery, feeling, or conceptual knowing. Everyday use retains the existing breath and command without requiring a new meditation or Focus-state transition. The process is intended to begin immediately while fulfillment is not assigned a guaranteed deadline. Lasting availability applies to deliberately chosen patterns, not every passing thought. Spiritual and energetic language expresses the practice's intention, not an established physical mechanism. Shared preparation, state, and return wording remain excluded. One body retains four-pass reuse. Existing source rights: user_cleared, per user's lawyer-clearance attestation. Revised wording awaits explicit editorial approval; predecessor approval and integrity records remain unchanged. Finished-session release remains pending.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-001.function-body/notes"
