        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-exp-002.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-EXP-002-Insulate.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, to establish your zone of temperature comfort,\ninhale deeply, hold your breath, and think\nor say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth.\n\nUse \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-EXP-002-CANCEL }}\" to end the current adjustment,\nor \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-EXP-002-RELEASE }}\" to place Insulate on hold.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Insulate exercise.",
