          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-002.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-002.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-FND-002-Focus.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, your ability to direct\nand sustain your attention is becoming stronger,\nclearer, and more effective.\n\nWhenever you wish to focus completely,\nchoose the activity, thought, or experience\nto which you desire to give your attention.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nYour mind, body, and senses will immediately\nbring their attention together, directing\nyour awareness toward the purpose you have chosen.\n\nYour concentration will become clear,\nsteady, and unwavering.\n\nUnnecessary distractions will fade away,\nand your attention will remain naturally\ncentered on what matters to you.\n\nYou will perceive important details clearly,\nunderstanding what you see, hear, feel,\nand experience with greater awareness.\n\nThe information you attend to will become\nvivid and distinct in your memory,\nready for clear and accurate recall.\n\nYou will remain bright, alert, calm,\nconfident, and completely at ease.\n\nFrom this moment forward, this ability\nto focus your attention is permanently\navailable to you whenever you desire.\n\nOnce you select your focus, your mind\nwill maintain it smoothly and naturally,\nwithout unnecessary strain or effort.\n\nYou remain in complete control,\nable to direct or shift your attention\nwhenever you choose.\n\nEach time you use {{ cue.primary }},\nconcentration becomes easier, stronger,\nand more effective.\n\nYour natural ability to focus will continue\nimproving through every experience,\nbecoming an effortless part of your daily life.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-002.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-002.function-body/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-FND-002-Focus.yaml",
