        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-003.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-FND-003-Quick-Recharge.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability\nto recharge and restore yourself through\na short period of natural, restful sleep.\n\nWhenever you choose to take a brief rest,\nsettle comfortably and allow your body\nand mind to become quiet and relaxed.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nYou will move easily and quickly\ninto peaceful, natural sleep.\n\nAs you sleep, your total self will begin\na rapid process of balance, equalization,\nand restoration throughout your system.\n\nYour body will release unnecessary tension.\nYour mind will settle and become clear.\nYour natural energies will replenish,\nbringing renewed strength and vitality.\n\nEvery part of your being will work together,\nrestoring harmony and refreshing you\nin the short time you have chosen to rest.\n\nWithin minutes, as your brief sleep completes,\nyou will awaken naturally, calm and confident,\nwith a clear mind and renewed energy.\n\nYou will feel refreshed, alert, and ready\nto continue what you wish to do.\n\nFrom this moment forward, the ability\nto enter restorative short sleep\nis permanently available whenever you choose.\n\nYour normal wakefulness remains bright and clear,\nand this response begins when you deliberately\nchoose to use {{ cue.primary }}.\n\nEach time you use this function,\nfalling asleep briefly, restoring your energy,\nand awakening refreshed will become\neasier, smoother, and more effective.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-003.function-body/text"
        },
