        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-005.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-FND-005-Reset.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability\nto change your physical and mental pattern\nquickly and completely whenever you desire.\n\nWhenever you feel tired, weary, or emotionally low,\nyou can immediately reset your state and return\nto renewed strength, clarity, and confidence.\n\nInhale deeply, close your eyes,\nand gently hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth\nand open your eyes.\n\nAs you exhale, weariness and heaviness\nwill flow out of your body and mind.\nWith each new breath, fresh energy and vitality\nwill flow throughout your entire system.\n\nYour body will feel renewed, balanced,\ncomfortable, and ready for action.\nYour mind will become clear, clean, sharp,\nand smooth, with bright, steady awareness.\n\nYour emotions will return to balance.\nYou will feel strong and sure,\ncalm and confident, ready to move forward.\n\nThis change will take place immediately,\nbringing your entire being into the\nclear, energized state you have chosen.\n\nFrom this moment forward, this ability\nto reset your state is permanently\navailable whenever you wish to use it.\n\nYour natural balance remains intact,\nand you can invoke this renewed wakefulness\nwhenever a change of pattern is desired.\n\nEach time you use {{ cue.primary }},\nthis shift becomes easier, faster,\nand more effective.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-005.function-body/text"
        },
