          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-FND-006-Release.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, when a temporary OCF function\nis no longer needed, bring that function\nclearly into your awareness.\n\nInhale deeply and hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Release exercise.",
