        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-006.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-FND-006-Release.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability\nto release any temporary OCF function\nwhen its present purpose is complete.\n\nThe function you have learned remains yours.\nYou can end its current application\nwithout losing the knowledge, ability,\nor benefits that remain part of you.\n\nWhenever you wish to release a temporary function,\nbring that function clearly into your awareness.\nKnow exactly what you are choosing to place on hold.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth.\n\nThe selected function's present application\nwill immediately begin to end.\nIts temporary effects will fade smoothly,\nand your body, mind, and emotions will return\nto their natural, balanced condition.\n\nThe function itself is not forgotten or erased.\nEverything you have learned remains available,\nready whenever you choose to activate it again.\n\nIf several temporary functions are working together,\nyou can bring that entire grouping into awareness\nand release their present applications together\nwith the same command.\n\nOnly the temporary application you select will end.\nYour other functions, lasting abilities,\nand natural patterns of healthy balance\nwill continue as appropriate.\n\nThis ability to release and reset\nselected applications is permanently\navailable to you whenever you desire.\n\nEach time you use {{ cue.primary }},\nending an application and returning\nto balance becomes easier, smoother,\nand more effective.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-fnd-006.function-body/text"
        },
