        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-lif-001.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-LIF-001-Habit-Freedom.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever an unwanted physical\nor mental habit begins to arise, bring\nthat pattern clearly into your awareness.\n\nInhale deeply and hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Habit Freedom exercise.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-lif-001.closer/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-lif-001.closer/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-LIF-001-Habit-Freedom.yaml",
          "value": "1.2.1",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-lif-001.closer/version"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-lif-001.function-body/cue_template/allowed/0": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-LIF-001-Habit-Freedom.yaml",
          "value": "cue.primary",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-lif-001.function-body/cue_template/allowed/0"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-lif-001.function-body/cue_template/function_id": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-LIF-001-Habit-Freedom.yaml",
          "value": "OCF-LIF-001",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-lif-001.function-body/cue_template/function_id"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-lif-001.function-body/status": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-LIF-001-Habit-Freedom.yaml",
          "value": "reviewed",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-lif-001.function-body/status"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-lif-001.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-LIF-001-Habit-Freedom.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability\nto eliminate any unwanted physical or mental\nhabit pattern that you choose to release.\n\nA habit is a pattern repeated until it begins\nto operate automatically. You can recognize\nsuch a pattern and change it at its source.\n\nWhenever the unwanted habit begins to arise,\nrecognize the particular pattern you wish\nto eliminate and bring it clearly into your mind.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nThe unwanted pattern will immediately\nbegin to weaken throughout your entire system.\n\nIts familiar impulse will become smaller,\nquieter, and less compelling, until it\nno longer directs your thoughts or actions.\n\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind,\nphysical body, and total self will release\nthe old pattern together, completely.\n\nEach time the pattern would once have occurred,\nyour freedom to choose will grow stronger.\nYour mind and body will respond naturally\nin the way you now desire.\n\nThe unwanted habit will continue fading\nuntil it is completely eliminated\nfrom your automatic responses.\n\nYour useful memories, knowledge, and skills\nwill remain intact, while the unwanted\npattern loses its place in your life.\n\nFrom this moment forward, this ability\nto change and eliminate unwanted habits\nis permanently available whenever you choose.\n\nThe more you use {{ cue.primary }},\nthe easier, faster, and more effective\nthis lasting change will become.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-lif-001.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-lif-001.function-body/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-LIF-001-Habit-Freedom.yaml",
          "value": "1.3.1",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-lif-001.function-body/version"
        },
