        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-prf-002.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-PRF-002-Inner-Power.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to strengthen\nyour awareness and expression of your total self,\ninhale deeply and hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Inner Power exercise.",
