        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-prf-003.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-PRF-003-Coordination.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to increase\nthe speed, smoothness, and coordination\nof your movement, inhale deeply\nand hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Coordination exercise.",
