        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-prf-003.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-PRF-003-Coordination.yaml",
          "value": "Beginning now, and from this moment forward,\nyour mind, nervous system, and muscles\nwill work together in ever greater harmony.\n\nSignals throughout your nervous system\nwill travel smoothly, evenly, and rapidly.\nYour muscles will respond in precise coordination,\nproducing the movement you intend\nat exactly the time it is needed.\n\nYour entire body will move with greater balance,\ngrace, accuracy, and natural ease.\nEach motion will flow into the next,\nwithout unnecessary hesitation, tension, or effort.\n\nYour awareness of your body's position,\nmovement, and timing will become clearer.\nYour hands, feet, eyes, and entire physical system\nwill coordinate naturally as one.\n\nWhen quick movement is needed,\nyour responses will be swift and accurate.\nWhen careful control is needed,\nyour movements will be steady and precise.\nSpeed and smoothness will work together,\neach in harmony with your intention.\n\nThis improved coordination will become\nan increasingly natural part of your daily life,\ngrowing stronger through movement and experience.\nYou will not need to consciously manage\neach separate muscle or action.\nYour total self will coordinate them together.\n\nWhenever you wish to strengthen\nthis synchronization even further,\ninhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nYour entire physical system will immediately\ncome into clearer, smoother coordination,\nresponding with effortless speed and control.\n\nEach time you use {{ cue.primary }},\nthis natural harmony of mind and body\nwill become easier, stronger, and more effective.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-prf-003.function-body/text"
        },
