          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-PRF-006-Strong-Quick.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, when an immediate need calls for extraordinary\nstrength and quickness, inhale deeply, hold your breath,\nand think or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth.\n\nWhen the need has passed, bring Strong-Quick to mind,\ninhale, hold your breath, think or say \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-PRF-006-RELEASE }},\"\nand exhale slowly through your mouth.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Strong-Quick exercise.",
