        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-prf-006.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-PRF-006-Strong-Quick.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, within your total self\nthere is an exceptional reserve of strength and quickness,\nready to be called upon when an immediate need arises.\n\nYou will recognize the moment that calls for action.\nYour awareness will become clear and direct.\nYour mind and body will unite around what must be done.\n\nWhen you need this extraordinary response,\nbring the necessary action clearly into your awareness.\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth.\n\nImmediately, your total self will respond as one.\nYour conscious mind, subconscious mind, nervous system,\nand muscles will work together in complete coordination.\n\nHesitation and unnecessary thought will fall away.\nYour movements will become direct, rapid, and precise.\nEvery part of your body needed for the action\nwill contribute its strength in perfect timing.\n\nYou will draw upon reserves of power and speed\nbeyond what you ordinarily recognize within yourself,\nconcentrating your entire capacity into the moment.\n\nYour awareness will remain clear.\nYour action will be decisive.\nThe strength and quickness you call upon\nwill be directed toward the immediate purpose.\n\nThis exceptional response is temporary,\narising when you deliberately call upon it.\nWhen its purpose is complete, bring Strong-Quick\nclearly into your awareness.\n\nInhale deeply, hold your breath,\nthink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-PRF-006-RELEASE }},\"\nand exhale slowly through your mouth.\n\nThe present application will end,\nand your physical system will return smoothly to balance.\nYour learned ability will remain available\nwhenever another need arises.\n\nEach time you use this function,\nyour total self will recognize and respond\nto your intention more readily and effectively.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-prf-006.function-body/text"
        },
