        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-sen-002.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SEN-002-Seeing.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to strengthen your\nphysical sight or the clarity of your inner images,\ninhale deeply and hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Seeing exercise.",
