        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-sen-002.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SEN-002-Seeing.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, your entire system of seeing,\nboth physical and within your mind, will become\nclearer, sharper, and more effective.\n\nYour eyes will maintain comfortable, balanced moisture.\nYour eyelids will blink smoothly, distributing\ntear fluid evenly and protecting your eyes.\n\nYour eyes will adapt naturally to changing light.\nTheir focusing structures will bring the patterns\nof light into increasingly clear detail.\n\nYour inner eyes will receive these patterns accurately,\nand your visual centers will process and understand\nthem with greater clarity, ease, and precision.\n\nAt the same time, your inner vision will grow stronger.\nYou will create images within your mind more readily,\nseeing them vividly, clearly, and in rich detail.\n\nYou can picture people, places, objects, and events;\nhold an image steadily; and change its shape,\ncolor, distance, or movement whenever you choose.\n\nImages from memory will become easier to recall,\nand new possibilities easier to picture.\nYour mind's eye will respond naturally to intention,\nimagination, and the direction of your total self.\n\nThese abilities will continue developing together,\nbecoming a permanent part of the way you see,\nremember, imagine, and understand.\n\nWhenever you wish to strengthen your physical sight,\nyour inner visualization, or both, inhale deeply\nand gently hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth.\n\nYour entire seeing system will respond to your intention,\nbecoming clearer, smoother, and more capable.\nEach time you use {{ cue.primary }}, these abilities\nwill become easier, stronger, and more effective.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-sen-002.function-body/text"
        },
