        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-sen-003.closer/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SEN-003-Smell.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, to regulate your perception of aromas\nor strengthen your inner sense of smell, close your eyes,\ninhale deeply, and hold your breath.\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}\"\nor \"{{ cue.id.OCF-CMD-SEN-003-SMELL-LESS }},\" according to your intention.\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth and open your eyes.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Smell exercise.",
