          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SLP-001-Restorative-Sleep.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to direct your total self\ntoward healing and restoration during sleep,\ninhale deeply and hold your breath.\n\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth,\nas though gently blowing out a candle.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Restorative Sleep exercise.",
