        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-slp-002.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SLP-002-Sleep.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability\nto enter normal, natural, restful sleep\nwhenever you consciously desire.\n\nWhen you choose to sleep, allow your body\nto settle comfortably and begin breathing\nslowly, deeply, and easily.\n\nAs you exhale, think or say in your mind,\n\"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\n\nWith each gentle breath and each repetition\nof this command, you will move more deeply\ninto calm, peaceful, natural sleep.\n\nYour thoughts will become quiet.\nUnnecessary effort and tension will fade.\nYour mind and body will recognize that\nthe time for comfortable sleep has arrived.\n\nYou will fall asleep smoothly and naturally,\nwithout needing to force or follow the process.\n\nDuring sleep, your total self will work\ntoward harmony, balance, and equalization.\nYour nervous system and physical body\nwill cooperate in their natural patterns\nof rest, maintenance, and renewal.\n\nEach part of your system will settle\ninto the rhythms appropriate for sleep,\nallowing your body and mind to recover\nand restore their natural vitality.\n\nYou will remain peacefully asleep for\nthe rest you desire, and awaken at the\ntime you have chosen, refreshed, alert,\nand ready to begin again.\n\nThis ability to enter restful sleep\nwill remain permanently available to you.\nIt begins when you choose to use it,\nleaving your ordinary waking state\nclear and active at other times.\n\nEach time you use {{ cue.primary }},\nentering natural sleep and awakening\nrefreshed will become easier and more effective.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-slp-002.function-body/text"
        },
