          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SLP-003-Dream-Theme.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, whenever you wish to experience\na dream of your choosing and recall it clearly,\nbring your desired dream theme into your mind.\nInhale deeply and hold your breath.\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\nThen exhale and breathe slowly and deeply.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Dream Theme exercise.",
