        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-slp-003.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SLP-003-Dream-Theme.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you can choose\nthe dreams you desire to experience during sleep.\n\nWhenever you wish to dream a particular dream,\nbring its theme clearly into your awareness.\nIt may be a place, a person, an experience,\na question, a possibility, or a world of your creation.\n\nPicture what you wish to experience.\nKnow how you wish the dream to feel.\nInclude the sights, sounds, sensations,\nand emotions that give your dream its character.\n\nInhale deeply and gently hold your breath.\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\nThen exhale and breathe slowly and deeply.\n\nYou will move calmly and easily\ninto peaceful, normal, natural sleep.\nAs you sleep, your total self will receive\nthe pattern you have chosen and begin\ncomposing a dream experience around it.\n\nYour conscious intention, subconscious awareness,\nand higher self will work together,\nshaping a living dream of images, feelings,\nmovement, and meaningful experience.\n\nThe dream may unfold in ways beyond\nwhat you first imagined, while remaining\nconnected to the theme you have selected.\nYou will experience it naturally and vividly,\nallowing each scene to lead into the next.\n\nWhen you awaken, the dream will return\nclearly to your awareness. You will remember\nits scenes, sensations, emotions, and details\nwith joy, and recognize the experience as your own.\n\nThis ability to choose, experience, and remember\nyour dreams will remain permanently available.\nEach time you use {{ cue.primary }},\nyour dream experiences and their recall\nwill become clearer, richer, and easier.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-slp-003.function-body/text"
        },
        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-slp-003.function-body/version": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SLP-003-Dream-Theme.yaml",
