          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SLP-005-Sleep-Easy.yaml",
          "value": "Remember, when you wish to sleep in unfamiliar\nor distracting surroundings, make yourself comfortable,\nclose your eyes, inhale deeply, and hold your breath.\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth\nand continue breathing naturally.\n\nThis concludes your OCF Sleep Easy exercise.",
