        "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-slp-005.function-body/text": {
          "file": "locales/en-US/OCF-SLP-005-Sleep-Easy.yaml",
          "value": "From this moment forward, you have the ability\nto enter natural, restful sleep wherever you choose,\neven when the place around you is unfamiliar\nor the conditions are changing and distracting.\n\nMake yourself as comfortable as the situation permits.\nClose your eyes, inhale deeply, and hold your breath.\nThink or say in your mind, \"{{ cue.primary }}.\"\nThen exhale slowly through your mouth\nand allow your breathing to become easy and natural.\n\nYour physical body will loosen and relax.\nYour thoughts will become quiet and unhurried.\nThe unfamiliar place will begin to feel ordinary,\nand your mind will accept it as a place for sleep.\n\nSounds may rise and fade around you.\nSome may be sudden, irregular, or unexpected.\nMovement, voices, light, and changing conditions\nwill no longer need to capture your attention.\n\nYour total self will distinguish what matters\nfrom ordinary background activity.\nUnimportant disturbances will pass through awareness\nwithout drawing you away from your chosen rest.\n\nIf a passing sound or movement briefly stirs you,\nyour body will settle again naturally.\nYour mind will release the interruption,\nyour breathing will remain comfortable,\nand sleep will return smoothly and easily.\n\nYou will no longer need perfect silence,\nfamiliar surroundings, or unchanging conditions\nto allow yourself peaceful, natural sleep.\n\nThis ability will remain permanently available,\nready whenever you choose to rest.\nEach use of {{ cue.primary }} will make it easier\nto fall asleep, remain asleep, and settle again\namid the ordinary changes around you.",
          "yaml_pointer": "/entries/hplus.function.ocf-slp-005.function-body/text"
        },
